{"id":270282171459589,"type":"song","name":"Dress You Up","artist":"Madonna","year":1985,"weight":18,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/cover/919db9b12e392ae3b2871877def1acb7/250x250-000000-80-0-0.jpg","album":"Dress You Up","yt":"mWtpd8mS5jw"},"artist_ref":{"id":120396521633899,"name":"Madonna","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Madonna_Rebel_Heart_Tour_2015_-_Stockholm_%2823051472299%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[],"lists":[{"id":167954413065108,"name":"UK Singles Chart","src":"charts","grp":"chart","list_year":null,"rank":5,"year":1986,"note":null,"total":730,"scaruffi":null},{"id":112464446304388,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1985","src":"singles","grp":"billboard_year_end","list_year":1985,"rank":98,"year":1985,"note":"","total":100,"scaruffi":null},{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","src":"charts","grp":"chart","list_year":null,"rank":98,"year":1985,"note":null,"total":6841,"scaruffi":null}],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"A song from Madonna's 1984 album, \"Like A Virgin.\" Along with other tracks from the album, its lyrics contributed to Madonna's emergence as a genuinely combative, feminist, and explicit artist, signaling her definitive shift towards a provocative persona. \"Tenemos el dress you up, tenemos el material.\"","year":1984,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"Madonna y la provocación","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P-1cItg41rc"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":null,"body":"The video for \"Dress You Up\" was filmed during Madonna's first headlining \"The Virgin Tour\" and epitomized \"Madonna Mania,\" featuring a concert audience filled with \"wannabes\" replicating her style, including floppy hair bows, lace gloves, and lingerie worn as outerwear. This single reached number five in October 1985. It was later omitted from \"The Immaculate Collection.\" \"Dress You Up captured the peak of Madonna Mania.\"","